Add one output and name it wash_time.
Set its range to [0 60].
Create membership functions for the input, such as low, medium, and high, and for the output, such as short, normal, and long.
Add rules such as:
If dirt is low, wash time is short.
If dirt is medium, wash time is normal.
If dirt is high, wash time is long.
